00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:24,000
Last mission to win this war.

2
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:42,000
Operation Seawolf is a war, thriller, action film directed by Steven Luke.

3
00:12:54,000 --> 00:13:00,000
During the last days of World War II, Germany, desperate for any last grasp to defeat
the allied powers, looked to their last remaining weapons and soldiers.

4
00:17:12,000 --> 00:17:18,000
The German Navy and the last remaining U-Boats were formed together for one desperate last
mission – a mission to attack the United States Homeland, known as Operation Seawolf.

5
00:21:30,000 --> 00:21:36,000
Captain Hans Kessler, a grizzled submarine commander from both World Wars, is called into
service to make one mission a success and help turn the tide of the war.

6
00:25:48,000 --> 00:25:54,000
Hans Kessler, played by Dolph Lundgren.

7
00:30:06,000 --> 00:30:12,000
Valentine, played by Aaron Courteau.

8
00:34:24,000 --> 00:34:30,000
Commander Ingram, played by Frank Grillo.

9
00:38:42,000 --> 00:38:48,000
Lt. Erich Reinhart, played by Andrew Stecker.

10
00:43:00,000 --> 00:43:06,000
Sam L. Gravely Jr., played by Hiram A. Murray.

11
00:47:18,000 --> 00:47:24,000
Lt. Randolf Lutz, played by Apostolos Gliarmis.

12
00:51:36,000 --> 00:51:42,000
The Silent Service (Japanese: 沈黙の艦隊, Hepburn: Chinmoku no Kantai) is a
Japanese manga series written and illustrated by Kaiji Kawaguchi.

13
00:55:54,000 --> 00:56:00,000
It was published in Kodansha's Weekly Morning manga magazine from
1988 to 1996 and collected in 32 tankōbon volumes.

14
01:00:12,000 --> 01:00:18,000
The series was adapted into an anime television special and
original video animation (OVA) series by Sunrise.

15
01:04:30,000 --> 01:04:36,000
The special was released in North America by Central Park Media.

16
01:08:48,000 --> 01:08:54,000
A live-action film adaptation premiered in Japanese theaters in September 2023 and a sequel,
titled The Silent Service: The Battle of Arctic Ocean, premiered in September 2025.

17
01:13:06,000 --> 01:13:12,000
In 1990, The Silent Service won the 14th Kodansha Manga
Award for the general manga category.

18
01:17:24,000 --> 01:17:30,000
It has over 25 million copies in circulation, making it
one of the best-selling manga series.

19
01:21:42,000 --> 01:21:48,000
The tone is intense.
